# Tamiyo, Upriser Crowned: "Whenever one or more creatures deal combat damage to you while you're the monarch, tap those
# creatures and put a stun counter on each of them" - each of them that is still a permanent (CR 603.2c, 701.26a). Bot2's
# Rancored Llanowar Elves (3/1 with trample) is blocked by Bot1's Baleful Strix (1/1 deathtouch): it deals 1 to the Strix
# and 2 trample damage to Bot1 in the same combat damage step, and dies to the Strix's deathtouch. The other Elves deals 1
# to Bot1. So the batch holds two creatures, but only the survivor is there to be stunned.

